OL,3,GNEWSAWycombe lodge football centre
OL,4,Aplans for golf course
OL,5,
OL,6,FWycombe Wanderers have formally
OL,7,Fsubmitted plans to reduce the size of
OL,8,Fan 18-hole golf course to make way for
OL,9,Fa football training ground.
OL,11,FThe Chairboys want to build the
OL,12,Ftraining base at South Buckinghamshire
OL,13,FGolf Course, but improve community
OL,14,Fsports facilities at the neighbouring
OL,15,FFarnham Park Playing Fields.
OL,17,FThe proposals would bring the club's
OL,18,Ffirst team and academy together on one
OL,19,Fsite, though it would see the golf
OL,20,Fcourse reduced to 12 holes, with a
OL,21,Fseparate six-hole academy course and
OL,22,Fpractice range provided.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
