OL,3,GNEWSAWycombe lodge football centre
OL,4,Aplans for golf course
OL,5,
OL,6,FWanderers took over the course and
OL,7,Fplaying fields in August through a
OL,8,Fpartnership with Buckinghamshire
OL,9,FCouncil. The authority is due to make a
OL,10,Fdecision on the plans by 21 January.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
